OL,3,ARussia strikes second major bridge in
OL,4,AKyiv, mayor says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Russian strike has hit a second major
OL,7,Fbridge in Kyiv, Mayor Vitali Klitschko
OL,8,Fsays.
OL,10,FThe attack damaged the road surface and
OL,11,Ftrolleybus overhead wires on the
OL,12,FNorthern Bridge, he said.
OL,14,FThe strike comes after the Southern
OL,15,FBridge has been targeted multiple times
OL,16,Fby Russian drones since Thursday.
OL,18,FThe bridges link the eastern and
OL,19,Fwestern parts of the capital and had
OL,20,Fnot been hit before Thursday's strikes,
OL,21,Fsignalling a new stage in Moscow's
OL,22,Fattacks.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
